{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "title_main_001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "# AI Auto Debug System\n## 四層自動除錯系統架構圖"
    },
    {
      "id": "group_frontend_01",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -50,
      "y": -50,
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5",
      "label": "Frontend / Visualization"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_dashboard_01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Dashboard\n**Flask Web UI**\n- Port: 5000\n- `/api/diagnosis`\n- `/api/stats`\n\n📁 `dashboard/app.py`"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_grafana_001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Grafana\n**可視化儀表板**\n- Port: 3000\n- Dashboards\n- Datasources\n\n📁 `grafana/provisioning/`"
    },
    {
      "id": "group_layer0_001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -50,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "4",
      "label": "Layer 0 - Data Collection & Storage"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_alloy_0001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## Alloy\n**日誌收集器**\n- Docker logs\n- Systemd logs\n\n📁 `layer0-collector/alloy/`"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_loki_00001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## Loki\n**日誌聚合**\n- Port: 3100\n- 31 天保留\n- Multi-tenant\n\n📁 `layer0-collector/loki/`"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_archiver_01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## Log Archiver\n**日誌同步**\n- Loki → TimescaleDB\n- 永久存儲\n\n📁 `layer0-storage/sync/`"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_timescale01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## TimescaleDB\n**時序資料庫**\n- Port: 5432\n- Hypertable\n- 永久存儲\n\n📁 `layer0-storage/timescaledb/`"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_promethe01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## Prometheus\n**指標監控**\n- Port: 9090\n- CPU/Memory\n- 容器指標\n\n📁 `prometheus/`"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_cadvisor01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## cAdvisor\n**容器監控**\n- Port: 8081\n- Container stats\n- Resource usage"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_dcgm_0001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## DCGM Exporter\n**GPU 監控**\n- Port: 9400\n- NVIDIA GPU\n- Memory/Utilization"
    },
    {
      "id": "group_layer1_001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -50,
      "y": 770,
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "2",
      "label": "Layer 1 - Anomaly Filtering"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_layer1_001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## Layer 1 Filter\n**異常過濾服務**\n- 從 Loki 拉取日誌\n- Pipeline 處理\n- 閾值: 0.5\n\n📁 `layer1-filter/src/`"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_logbert_01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## LogBERT\n**BERT 異常檢測**\n- Transformer 模型\n- 異常分數計算\n- Batch 處理\n\n📁 `logbert/src/anomaly_detector.py`"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_anomalydb1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## Anomaly Store\n**異常存儲**\n- PostgreSQL\n- `anomaly_logs` 表\n- 時間戳索引\n\n📁 `layer1-filter/src/storage/`"
    },
    {
      "id": "group_layer2_001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -50,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 500,
      "color": "3",
      "label": "Layer 2 - Root Cause Analysis"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_consumer_01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1170,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## Anomaly Consumer\n**異常消費者**\n- 從 PostgreSQL 讀取\n- 批次處理\n\n📁 `layer2-analyzer/src/`"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_aggregat01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 1170,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## Aggregator\n**異常聚類**\n- 時間窗口\n- 模式識別\n- 去重處理\n\n📁 `root_cause_analyzer/`"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_correlat01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 1170,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## Metrics Correlator\n**指標關聯**\n- Prometheus 查詢\n- CPU/Memory\n- 時間關聯\n\n📁 `root_cause_analyzer/`"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_knowledg01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 1170,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## Knowledge Base\n**知識庫**\n- ChromaDB\n- RAG 檢索\n- 歷史案例\n\n📁 `root_cause_analyzer/`"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_llmreaso01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1340,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## LLM Reasoner\n**LLM 推理引擎**\n- OpenAI API\n- Ollama (本地)\n- Cascade 策略\n\n📁 `root_cause_analyzer/llm_reasoner.py`"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_rawfetch01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 1340,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## Raw Log Fetcher\n**原始日誌獲取**\n- 上下文補充\n- 時間範圍查詢\n\n📁 `layer2-analyzer/src/`"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_suggesti01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 580,
      "y": 1340,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## Suggestion Generator\n**建議生成**\n- 規則引擎\n- LLM 增強\n- 修復建議\n\n📁 `layer2-analyzer/src/`"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_notifica01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 1340,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## Notification Hub\n**通知中樞**\n- 嚴重程度過濾\n- 多通道分發\n\n📁 `layer2-analyzer/src/`"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_diagnost01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 1240,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## Diagnosis Reports\n**診斷報告存儲**\n- PostgreSQL\n- `diagnosis_reports` 表\n- 根因分析結果\n- 修復建議"
    },
    {
      "id": "group_layer3_001",
      "type": "group",
      "x": -50,
      "y": 1690,
      "width": 1500,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "1",
      "label": "Layer 3 - Remediation & Notification"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_slack_001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1740,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "## Slack\n**Slack 通知**\n- Webhook 整合\n- 嚴重性過濾\n- 格式化訊息\n- Channel 配置"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_webhook_01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 1740,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "## Webhook\n**自定義 Webhook**\n- HTTP POST\n- JSON Payload\n- 自定義端點\n- 重試機制"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_remediat01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 1740,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "## Auto Remediation\n**自動修復** (預設關閉)\n- `AUTO_REMEDIATION_ENABLED=false`\n- 僅唯讀操作標記為安全\n- 需人工確認\n\n📁 `layer3-remediation/`"
    },
    {
      "id": "group_database_01",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "6",
      "label": "Database Tables"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_tables_001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1120,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## TimescaleDB Tables\n\n### raw_logs\n- RAW 日誌永久存儲\n- Hypertable\n\n### anomaly_logs\n- 異常日誌\n- Layer 1 輸出\n\n### diagnosis_reports\n- 診斷報告\n- Layer 2 輸出\n\n### knowledge_cases\n- 知識庫案例\n- 歷史參考"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_docker_001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 770,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## Docker Containers\n**被監控的容器**\n- 應用服務\n- 系統服務\n- 日誌輸出\n\n→ Alloy 收集"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_llm_ext_01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 1690,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## External LLM\n**外部 AI 服務**\n\n### OpenAI API\n- GPT-4 / GPT-3.5\n\n### Ollama\n- 本地部署\n- llama / mistral"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_ingester_01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## Ingester\n**異常接收器**\n- Port: 8000\n- FastAPI\n- PostgreSQL 寫入\n\n📁 `layer1-filter/ingester/`"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_l2webhook01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1300,
      "y": 1100,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## Layer 2 Webhook\n**即時分析觸發**\n- Port: 8080\n- `/api/webhooks/anomaly`\n- Background processing\n\n📁 `layer2-analyzer/src/main.py`"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_fanout_001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 850,
      "y": 950,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## Fan-out Architecture\n**Alloy HTTP Receiver (Port 9999)**\n\nLogBERT → POST :9999 → 同時轉發:\n- Ingester :8000 (DB 留存)\n- Layer 2 Webhook :8080 (即時分析)"
    }
  ],
